{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TestExhaustivity"}],"title":"TestExhaustivity","remoteSource":{"fileName":"TestExhaustivity.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/InnoSquadCorp\/InnoRouter\/blob\/5.2.0\/Sources\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity.swift#L25"},"modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterTesting"}],"externalID":"s:17InnoRouterTesting16TestExhaustivityO"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Controls how strictly a test store checks pending events when observation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finishes.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TestExhaustivity"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"InnoRouter’s test stores follow TCA’s "},{"code":"TestStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" exhaustivity model:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events collected from the underlying authority’s unified "},{"code":"onEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callback accumulate in an internal queue. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"receive(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" call dequeues the next event and asserts a predicate. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"code":".strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the store reports events left pending at "},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deallocation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"assertNoPendingEvents()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a non-terminal checkpoint: it reports and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumes the current pending snapshot, then continues observing. "},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closes the queue, consumes its final snapshot, and reports the first event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emitted after that boundary in both exhaustivity modes."}]},{"name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Testing currently attributes issues recorded inside an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isolated "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deinit"},{"type":"text","text":" to an "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"unknown test","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rather than to the test that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owned the store, which makes a deinit-time leftover-event failure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hard to locate. Until that is resolved upstream, await all work and end"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each test with an explicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":". It runs the strict check with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller’s source location and disarms the deinit-time fallback."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kin